{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "要求公开道歉  (Demanding a Public Apology)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Reporting to Unit One for overtime, Bu Xiaogu gets a rapid briefing from Xingzi on the fallout from the red-carpet quarrel that upset DTS network bosses. Listen to their Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天来制作一部加班啦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "赶快快来！两个嘉宾在盛典上吵架的事情，电视台特别不满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们必须要挽回负面影响。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经绕开孙总，点名要求我们一部善后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "十二歌王已经季后巡演到一半，文娱论每周都要播出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所有的信息资料发你邮箱里了，自己看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我太多事情要做了，你先联系萧尧和吕怡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要求他们必须当众公开道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，盛典出了这种事，是不是就代表不成功啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "总体成功，只不过他们俩吵架的事情转移了红毯的注意力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实那天红毯的氛围真的挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天来制作一部加班啦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am here working overtime in Production Unit One today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "赶快快来！两个嘉宾在盛典上吵架的事情，电视台特别不满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry over here! The network is very unhappy about the two guests arguing at the gala.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们必须要挽回负面影响。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have to undo the negative impact.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经绕开孙总，点名要求我们一部善后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Deng bypassed Mr Sun and specifically asked Unit One to clean this up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "十二歌王已经季后巡演到一半，文娱论每周都要播出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Twelve Singers is halfway through its post-season tour, and Entertainment Talk airs every week.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所有的信息资料发你邮箱里了，自己看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All the background files have been sent to your inbox; look through them yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我太多事情要做了，你先联系萧尧和吕怡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have too much on my plate, so contact Xiao Yao and Lv Yi first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要求他们必须当众公开道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Demand that they issue a public apology in front of everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，盛典出了这种事，是不是就代表不成功啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, since this happened at the gala, does that mean it was unsuccessful?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "总体成功，只不过他们俩吵架的事情转移了红毯的注意力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Overall it succeeded; their quarrel simply distracted attention from the red carpet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实那天红毯的氛围真的挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, the atmosphere on the red carpet that day was really great.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天来制作一部加班啦。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "赶快快来！两个嘉宾在盛典上吵架的事情，电视台特别不满。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们必须要挽回负面影响。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经绕开孙总，点名要求我们一部善后。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "十二歌王已经季后巡演到一半，文娱论每周都要播出。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所有的信息资料发你邮箱里了，自己看一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我太多事情要做了，你先联系萧尧和吕怡。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要求他们必须当众公开道歉。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，盛典出了这种事，是不是就代表不成功啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "总体成功，只不过他们俩吵架的事情转移了红毯的注意力。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实那天红毯的氛围真的挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Reassured that the Star Night gala still hit record ratings overall, Xiaogu sets off to demand a public apology from the two commentators. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
